Data that is not part of this repository

  Face tracking models (MediaPipe, ICT-FaceKit and others) are downloaded at
  run time and keep their own licenses. The tracker reports which models allow
  commercial use.
  Live2D sample models and the Live2D Cubism SDK are not included and are not
  redistributed. Users download them and accept Live2D's terms themselves.
  Yorishiro renders Live2D models with Ayagami and does not ship Live2D Cubism
  Core.

